n/QOU/Eightfold/SecondMarkovTrace.lean#L68-L76","doc":"The colour tower's Hopf trace `tr(σ₁²) = (q⁶+q²+1)/(q⁴+q²+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.SecondMarkovTrace.colourTower_z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.SecondMarkovTrace.colourTower_z","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/SecondMarkovTrace.lean#L64-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.SecondMarkovTrace.colourTower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.SecondMarkovTrace.colourTower","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/SecondMarkovTrace.lean#L60-L62","doc":"The colour tower: the rank-3 member. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.SecondMarkovTrace.towerAtRank_two_eq_canonical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.SecondMarkovTrace.towerAtRank_two_eq_canonical","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/SecondMarkovTrace.lean#L45-L58","doc":"**At rank 2 the tower is convention D**, i.e. the production instance. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.SecondMarkovTrace.towerAtRank","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.SecondMarkovTrace.towerAtRank","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/SecondMarkovTrace.lean#L36-L43","doc":"The rank-`N` Markov-trace tower: Markov parameter `z_N`, Hopf trace\n`h·z_N + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}